## Issue / fix: Fix agent being able to execute tools that are turned off

## Description
#### Closes #54741

Fix disabled context server tools being callable in profiles with `enable_all_context_servers: true`

`AgentProfileSettings::is_context_server_tool_enabled` short-circuited on `enable_all_context_servers` and ignored explicit per-tool `false` entries in `context_servers`, so agents could still call tools the user had disabled in their profile.
The filter now matches what the tool picker UI already does (`tool_picker.rs:357-371`): the explicit per-tool setting wins, and `enable_all_context_servers` is only consulted as a fallback when the tool has no explicit entry.

