## Issue / fix: Fix/engine resize

## Description
Fixes #6038 

Introduced a centralized helper fun (handle_store_mdb_error) in crates/milli/src/error.rs to handle store errors consistently.

The helper fun :
1. Passes through MDB_MAP_FULL unchanged, allowing the engine to detect it and resize the LMDB map.
2. Wraps all other LMDB errors into InternalError::StorePut / InternalError::StoreDeletion with proper context.
3. Passes through non-LMDB heed::Errors unchanged.
4. Updated all direct database.put / database.delete call sites to use this helper instead of wrapping errors inline.

