## Issue / fix: Deprecate dryRun mutation, add query impl for it

## Description
Closes #2717

## Description

For some reason, dryRun was originally created as a GraphQL mutation instead of a query. Since the operation doesn't actually perform any modifications, this seems like a mistake. This PR adds identical query, and marks the mutation is deprecated. No changes to the client are done, so it continues working with older versions. This is completely non-breaking change, but prepares us to potentially perform the breaking change in the future.

