## Issue / fix: fix: 8531 - elicitation fixes

## Description
Fixes #8531 

Fixes three elicitation bugs surfaced by FastMCP servers (#8531): elicitations with no schema (`response_type=None`) now render an Accept button instead of a dead form, and required enum fields default to their first option so users aren't blocked by a spurious "required" error. Also fixes the "Failed to Load Session" crash by routing elicitation responses through the agent's short-circuit path instead of opening a second SSE stream that collides with the in-flight tool call.

