## Issue / fix: fix: Resolve multiple files deadlock in CSV async reader

## Description
fixes #26985 (to the extent that the reproducer represents the original issue)

The underlying issue is that `begin_read()` makes a blocking call, e.g. from `read_until_start_and_infer_schema` which calls `blocking_recv()` on the `StreamBufReader`.

The alternate solutioning routes would be to move the blocking call out of the synchronous `begin_read()` or make `begin_read()` an async function. Or redesign the CSV scanner to be async end-to-end.

fyi @nameexhaustion

